  mm.sv  § unpackedElemVecTypedefPkgDef (ParamEmit emitPackage, the existing
        struct/union/enum Elem_typespec rebind loop just past the typedef
        pass).  The FINISHED HALF of pass 5's § unpackedElemVecTypedef, which
        was left partial BY MEASUREMENT: emitPackage emits a package's
        PARAMETERS before its TYPEDEFS, so typedefTs has no entry when
        makeUnpackedArrayParamTs asks and the element typespec is minted
        ANONYMOUS in the package's OWN listing only.  The loop that already
        re-points an unpacked-array-of-STRUCT element after the typedef pass
